gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "You're awake... Good.\p"
	.string "For a moment, I thought it had\n"
	.string "forgotten you too.\p"
	.string "My name is BIRCH.\p"
	.string "I'm a POKéMON PROFESSOR...\n"
	.string "or at least, I used to be.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is what we call a “POKéMON.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "POKéMON have always lived beside us.\p"
	.string "But lately, something is wrong.\p"
	.string "Names vanish from records. People\n"
	.string "forget friends they knew for years.\p"
	.string "Some POKéMON disappear... and no one\n"
	.string "remembers they ever existed.\p"
	.string "No one except me.\p"
	.string "And now, perhaps... you.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And you are?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "{PLAYER}...\p"
	.string "Yes. That name is still here.\p"
	.string "You're moving to LITTLEROOT.\n"
	.string "Please remember that.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "Listen carefully.\p"
	.string "When you arrive, things may seem\n"
	.string "normal. They are not.\p"
	.string "If someone tells you a person never\n"
	.string "existed, don't believe them.\p"
	.string "And if you hear your name called\n"
	.string "from somewhere empty... don't answer.\p"
	.string "Find me in LITTLEROOT.\n"
	.string "Before I forget why I called you.\p"
	.string "$"
